{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/learn/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/page,_N_T_/learn/how-to-read-order-book-five-levels"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--2DJ2zhzL_dHSrK5QsdDKA--><html lang=\"zh-TW\" data-density=\"comfortable\" data-font-size=\"standard\" class=\"__variable_07e1b6 __variable_cc7473 h-full antialiased\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/3d26d2f3aa81a833-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/604a121a6fa1a135-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/6e1768769e6f59a2-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/ab2e3a11646b0499-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/75c047ba52e43fcc.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/aa90c9a426448e43.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/e55779c04dd245e2.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/8c57d5c3b938342e.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/3eaf36e367672966.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-100b9d70ed4e49c1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1255-ab54a41c275880be.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-acf4587a940f1946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/learn/%5Bslug%5D/page-f7b99344f7e2ee16.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>五檔掛單怎麼看？委買、委賣與實際成交的差別｜股市大佬 TradeBoss</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"五檔是買賣雙方目前排在前面的委託價格與數量；逐筆成交才是已完成交易的紀錄。委買很多，不代表股價接下來一定上漲；掛單消失，也不一定是有人故意掛假單。\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script>(function(){try{var t=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-theme');if(t!=='light'&&t!=='dark')t='dark';document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t);document.documentElement.style.colorScheme=(t==='light'?'light':'dark');}catch(e){document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme','dark');}})();(function(){try{if(localStorage.getItem('obsidian-comfort-read')==='1')document.documentElement.classList.add('comfort-read');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var s=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-updown');if(s==='us')document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-updown','us');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var prefs=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('bs-preferences-v1')||'{}');var root=document.documentElement;prefs=prefs&&typeof prefs==='object'?prefs:{};root.setAttribute('data-font-size',['standard','large','xlarge','huge'].indexOf(prefs.fontSize)>=0?prefs.fontSize:'standard');root.setAttribute('data-density',prefs.density==='compact'?'compact':'comfortable');}catch(e){}})();</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground selection:bg-cyan/30 review-mode pb-40 lg:pb-16\" data-review-theme=\"dark\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"skip-link fixed left-3 top-3 z-[80] -translate-y-24 rounded-xl bg-accent px-4 py-2 font-black text-bg shadow-lg transition focus:translate-y-0\">跳到主要內容</a><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"LearnArticle_wrap__LIQ8G\"><article class=\"LearnArticle_article__2nBbk\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_meta__etj_G\"><a class=\"LearnArticle_cat__GQMlg\" href=\"/learn?c=orderbook\">盤口掛單</a><span class=\"LearnArticle_read__QEj6a\">閱讀約 2 分鐘</span></p><h1 class=\"LearnArticle_title__0_la8\">五檔掛單怎麼看？委買、委賣與實際成交的差別</h1><details class=\"LearnArticle_toc__LcSAa\"><summary class=\"LearnArticle_tocSummary__YBddG\">本文目錄</summary><ol class=\"LearnArticle_tocList__Rq_Lz\"><li><a href=\"#sec-1\">先分清楚你看到哪一種數字</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-2\">用一個假設例子看懂</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-3\">在App怎麼對照？</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-4\">收盤或缺資料時怎麼看？</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-5\">掛單多、突然消失，就能判定主力嗎？</a></li></ol></details><div class=\"LearnArticle_body__6B7Mb\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_intro__ATV5c\">五檔是買賣雙方目前排在前面的委託價格與數量；逐筆成交才是已完成交易的紀錄。委買很多，不代表股價接下來一定上漲；掛單消失，也不一定是有人故意掛假單。</p><section id=\"sec-1\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">先分清楚你看到哪一種數字</h2><div class=\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\"><table class=\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\"><thead><tr><th>畫面</th><th>代表什麼</th><th>不能直接推論什麼</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>委買／委賣五檔</td><td>該次快照中的委託價格與數量</td><td>不等於已成交，也不涵蓋所有價位委託</td></tr><tr><td>逐筆成交</td><td>資料源提供的成交紀錄</td><td>無法單憑紀錄確認特定分點或交易者</td></tr><tr><td>累計成交量</td><td>當日截至資料時間的成交累計</td><td>不是剛剛那一筆成交量</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"sec-2\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">用一個假設例子看懂</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">假設畫面委買100元有20張，下一次快照剩下5張。這只表示該價位顯示量減少15張；期間可能有成交、撤單、新增委託或快照間漏掉的變化。沒有同步成交與完整委託資料，不能直接把15張全算成撤單。</p></section><section id=\"sec-3\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">在App怎麼對照？</h2><ol class=\"LearnArticle_listNum__86N5S\"><li>登入後開啟<a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/diary\">盤中工作區</a>，輸入股票代號並查詢。</li><li>在「盤口／五檔」先看股票代號、資料時間及單位。</li><li>切到「逐筆成交」查看同一股票的紀錄，注意兩邊資料時間是否一致。</li><li>從通知進來時，可以按「同頁查看」切換股票；通知時間不等於目前行情時間。</li></ol></section><section id=\"sec-4\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">收盤或缺資料時怎麼看？</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">收盤後顯示的是系統實際取得的最後快照，請以畫面日期與時間為準，不保證每檔都剛好有13:30那一筆。若未取得資料，不能用舊資料冒充當日行情。</p></section><section id=\"sec-5\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">掛單多、突然消失，就能判定主力嗎？</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">不能。五檔是委託資訊，不是帳戶身分；單張快照無法證明下單意圖。可以觀察變化，但不能據此宣稱已確認主力進出或下一步漲跌。</p><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">延伸閱讀：<a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/how-to-enable-notify\">通知設定與常見檢查</a>。尚未安裝可前往<a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/diary\">App安裝頁</a>；已有帳號可直接登入使用。</p></section><div class=\"LearnArticle_related__9qV55\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_relatedTitle__RXfrl\">相關文章</p><a class=\"LearnArticle_relatedLink__mibXe\" href=\"/learn/how-to-enable-notify\">通知設定與常見檢查</a></div></div></article></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[81259,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[89379,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[98924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[10021,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n7:I[10528,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n8:I[50861,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\nc:I[57150,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/3d2